   framework. Certification requires engagement with an accredited external
   auditor and is the responsibility of the deploying organization.

   Per the framework\'s PHILOSOPHY.md: every compliance assertion produced by
   this tool is a real assertion, signed and traceable, or honestly absent.
   If this tool says a control is "not yet implemented," the control is not
   in effect; do not interpret absence as compliance.
